        "text": "theorem after_pulse_open {r eta : ℝ} (hr : W.controls.heatJoin < r)\n    (hp : (r, eta) ∈ W.domain.carrier)\n    (hfar : OutgoingDilation.pulseEndRadius F W.controls.radius ≤ r) :\n    W.U (r, eta) = 0 ∧ (∫ x in Ioc 0 r, W.U (x, eta)) = 0"
